---
title: 4 Processing Modes Explained
---
%%{init: {'theme':'dark', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor':'#b4ff00'}}}%%
graph TD
    Start[Upload Bank Statement] --> DetectMode{Select Processing Mode}
    
    DetectMode -->|Mode 1| FullScan["📊 FULL SCAN MUTREK"]
    DetectMode -->|Mode 2| DailyBalance["📅 CEK SALDO TERAKHIR"]
    DetectMode -->|Mode 3| IDEB["📋 IDEB SLIK ANALYZER"]
    DetectMode -->|Mode 4| Angsuran["💰 ANGSURAN / PROYEKSI KOP"]
    
    FullScan --> FS_Process["• Parse all transactions<br/>• Calculate debit/credit<br/>• Monthly breakdown<br/>• Mutation statistics"]
    FS_Process --> FS_Output["<b>Output:</b><br/>full_scan_*.xlsx<br/>• Complete transaction list<br/>• Monthly summary<br/>• Total Debit/Credit<br/>• Frequency stats"]
    
    DailyBalance --> DB_Process["• Extract daily closing<br/>• Group by date<br/>• Last balance per day<br/>• Timeline tracking"]
    DB_Process --> DB_Output["<b>Output:</b><br/>daily_balance_*.xlsx<br/>• Date | Balance<br/>• Easy copy to Excel<br/>• Filter per month<br/>• Quick tracking"]
    
    IDEB --> IDEB_Process["• Parse IDEB SLIK PDF<br/>• Filter Baki Debet > 0<br/>• Extract credit data<br/>• Loan analysis"]
    IDEB_Process --> IDEB_Output["<b>Output:</b><br/>ideb_slik_*.xlsx<br/>• Active loans only<br/>• Outstanding balance<br/>• Credit details<br/>• Risk assessment"]
    
    Angsuran --> ANG_Process["• Batch Excel upload<br/>• Filter bulan/tahun<br/>• Calculate outstanding<br/>• Porsi pokok & margin"]
    ANG_Process --> ANG_Output["<b>Output:</b><br/>angsuran_kop_*.xlsx<br/>• Proyeksi per member<br/>• Outstanding calc<br/>• Pokok & margin split<br/>• KOP format ready"]
    
    FS_Output --> End[Download or Copy]
    DB_Output --> End
    IDEB_Output --> End
    ANG_Output --> End
    
